0..63 Comment "/// This source compares a stuck call with the form required by"
64..87 Comment "/// its parameter type."
88..91 Comment "///"
92..154 Comment "/// `composedHere` has a type over the composite of two paths."
155..223 Comment "/// The `passed` declarations apply it to variables and stuck calls."
224..227 Comment "///"
228..293 Comment "/// The checker evaluates pure calls in the types that it checks."
294..356 Comment "/// The kernel replays each declaration at its evaluated form."
357..435 Comment "/// The instantiated type reads a stuck argument as the stated type writes it."
436..439 Comment "///"
440..515 Comment "/// - see: #4065 — the checker refused a stuck call passed to a parameter"
516..585 Comment "/// - see: #4038 — a composite by a definition over stuck endpoints"
586..638 Comment "/// - see: #720 — a call argument\'s form in a type"
